<panel width="420" height="500" background-color="#000a18" background-opacity="0.95" border-radius="12" border-color="#00ffcc" border-width="2" flex-direction="column" align-items="center" padding="20" gap="8">
  <div font-size="24" font-weight="bold" color="#00ffcc" margin-bottom="8">HOW TO PLAY</div>
  <div font-size="14" color="#ffffff">Walk over burger ingredients</div>
  <div font-size="14" color="#ffffff">to drop them onto the plate below.</div>
  <div font-size="14" color="#ffcc00" margin-top="8">CONTROLS:</div>
  <div font-size="12" color="#ffffff">Arrow Keys / WASD - Move</div>
  <div font-size="12" color="#ffffff">Space / F - Use Pepper</div>
  <div font-size="12" color="#ffffff">Esc / P - Pause</div>
  <div font-size="14" color="#ff4444" margin-top="8">ENEMIES:</div>
  <div font-size="12" color="#ffffff">Avoid Mr. Hot Dog, Mr. Pickle</div>
  <div font-size="12" color="#ffffff">and Mr. Egg!</div>
  <div font-size="14" color="#ff8800" margin-top="8">TIPS:</div>
  <div font-size="12" color="#ffffff">Drop ingredients on enemies for</div>
  <div font-size="12" color="#ffffff">bonus points. Use pepper wisely!</div>
  <div font-size="12" color="#ffffff">Complete all burgers to advance.</div>
  <panel id="btn-tutorial-back" width="240" height="40" background-color="#004433" border-radius="6" border-color="#00ffcc" border-width="1" align-items="center" justify-content="center" cursor="pointer" margin-top="8">
    <div font-size="14" color="#00ffcc">BACK</div>
  </panel>
</panel>
